    fix(pi): preserve image prompts and canonical identities on replay
    
    Replay native image blocks, including image-only prompts. Persist exact native
    entry to client message associations in the existing Pi persistence handle,
    and restore canonical wire identities while retaining native rewind targets.
    
    Cover captured native image history, real AgentStorage disk reload, prime and
    forced hydration, and legacy handles without inferred client identities.
    
